---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="微风网络官网｜2026机场推荐・稳定专线机场推荐" 
  description="微风网络官方网站，提供稳定高速的网络连接服务、套餐与使用教程，并整理2026机场推荐、稳定机场推荐、专线机场推荐、梯子推荐及Clash使用指南，帮助用户选择适合自己的网络方案。"
>
  <main class="bg-breeze-dark min-h-screen font-sans">
    
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="relative pt-32 pb-24 px-4 overflow-hidden border-b border-white/5">
      <!-- Dynamic Image Background -->
      <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none">
        <!-- 基础背景图 -->
        <img src="/hero-bg.jpg" alt="微风网络核心架构" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-60 mix-blend-lighten" />
        <!-- 渐变遮罩：让顶部文字清晰，底部完美融入下一区块的深色 -->
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#0B1628]/70 via-[#0B1628]/50 to-breeze-dark"></div>
        <!-- 侧边柔和遮罩：集中视觉焦点 -->
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#0B1628]/80 via-transparent to-[#0B1628]/80"></div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center relative z-10">
        <h1 class="text-breeze-cyan font-bold tracking-widest text-xs md:text-sm mb-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-4">
          <span class="w-12 h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent to-breeze-cyan/50"></span>
          微风网络官网｜2026稳定机场推荐
          <span class="w-12 h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-l from-transparent to-breeze-cyan/50"></span>
        </h1>
        <div class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-black text-white mb-8 tracking-tight" role="heading" aria-level="2">稳定连接，<br class="md:hidden"/>像微风一样自然。</div>
        <p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-400 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          欢迎访问微风网络官方网站。<br class="hidden md:block"/>
          无论是日常浏览网页、4K 流媒体观影，还是处理高强度的 AI 工作，我们都能为您提供坚实稳定的基础网络设施。
        </p>
        
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12 text-left backdrop-blur-sm">
          <h2 class="text-breeze-cyan font-bold mb-2">关于微风网络</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
            <strong class="text-white">breezenetwork.org</strong> 是微风网络官方品牌网站，提供套餐信息、线路说明、客户端下载、使用教程与服务支持。致力于为全球用户提供无感、极速的跨网络连接体验。
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Trust Tags -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 mb-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          <div class="bg-[#131F33] border border-white/10 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-300 flex items-center gap-2 shadow-lg shadow-black/20">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-breeze-cyan" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg> 
            多平台设备支持
          </div>
          <div class="bg-[#131F33] border border-white/10 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-300 flex items-center gap-2 shadow-lg shadow-black/20">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-breeze-cyan" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4"></path></svg> 
            完美兼容 Clash / Mihomo
          </div>
          <div class="bg-[#131F33] border border-white/10 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-300 flex items-center gap-2 shadow-lg shadow-black/20">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-breeze-cyan" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg> 
            专线架构与优质中转
          </div>
          <div class="bg-[#131F33] border border-white/10 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-300 flex items-center gap-2 shadow-lg shadow-black/20">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-breeze-cyan" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"></path></svg> 
            完善的使用教程
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
          <a href="/pricing" class="bg-breeze-cyan text-[#0B1628] font-bold px-8 py-4 rounded-xl hover:bg-cyan-400 transition-all shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(34,211,238,0.3)] hover:-translate-y-1">
            查看订阅套餐
          </a>
          <a href="/network" class="text-white bg-[#131F33] px-8 py-4 rounded-xl hover:bg-[#1a2b47] border border-gray-700 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1">
            了解微风网络
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 认识微风网络 -->
    <section class="py-24 px-4 relative">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-6">重新定义您的跨境网络体验</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Breeze Network 致力于为您提供无感知的国际网络体验。我们不追求繁杂的噱头，只专注于最核心的三件事：<strong class="text-gray-200">连得上、速度快、不掉线</strong>。
          </p>
          <a href="/network" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-breeze-cyan hover:text-cyan-400 font-medium transition-colors">
            深入了解我们的网络架构 <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="bg-[#131F33] p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 shadow-xl">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">稳定连接</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">优化的路由分发机制，通过国内高防 BGP 接入，大幅降低跨国传输丢包率。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-[#131F33] p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 shadow-xl">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">灵活节点</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">网络架构覆盖香港、日本、新加坡、美国等亚欧与北美核心区域。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-[#131F33] p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 shadow-xl">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">全平台覆盖</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">支持 Windows, Mac, iOS, Android 甚至路由器等各类常见系统的代理客户端。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-[#131F33] p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 shadow-xl">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">清晰指南</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">拒绝谜语人，我们提供从零开始的详细图文教程与智能故障诊断器。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 网络与线路 -->
    <section class="py-24 px-4 bg-[#0B1628] border-y border-white/5 relative overflow-hidden">
      <!-- bg pattern -->
      <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03]" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 2px 2px, white 1px, transparent 0); background-size: 32px 32px;"></div>
      
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto relative z-10">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">全球基础设施与专线架构</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">针对不同的网络环境与需求，我们提供优质大带宽中转与极速专线等多种底层架构。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-b from-[#131F33] to-transparent p-8 rounded-3xl border border-white/5">
            <div class="text-green-400 font-mono text-sm mb-4">区域覆盖</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">核心节点地区</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-6">精选距离大陆最近的骨干机房，实现极速响应。</p>
            <ul class="space-y-4">
              <li class="flex justify-between items-center text-sm"><span class="text-gray-300 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-green-500"></span> Hong Kong</span> <span class="text-gray-500 font-mono">香港</span></li>
              <li class="flex justify-between items-center text-sm"><span class="text-gray-300 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-green-500"></span> Japan</span> <span class="text-gray-500 font-mono">日本</span></li>
              <li class="flex justify-between items-center text-sm"><span class="text-gray-300 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-green-500"></span> Singapore</span> <span class="text-gray-500 font-mono">新加坡</span></li>
              <li class="flex justify-between items-center text-sm"><span class="text-gray-300 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-green-500"></span> United States</span> <span class="text-gray-500 font-mono">美国</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="lg:col-span-2 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#131F33] to-[#0d1627] p-8 rounded-3xl border border-white/5 relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="text-breeze-cyan font-mono text-sm mb-4">架构解析</div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-8">优质中转 与 IPLC / IEPL 专线的区别</h3>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-white font-medium mb-3 border-l-2 border-gray-600 pl-3">优质中转线路</h4>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">通过国内高防 BGP 服务器接管流量，抹平运营商差异。带宽极大，非常适合下载大文件与观看 4K 高清流媒体，是极具性价比的日常首选。</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-white font-medium mb-3 border-l-2 border-breeze-cyan pl-3">IPLC 极速专线</h4>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">物理层面上独立于公网的跨境光缆，完全免疫晚高峰网络拥堵（QoS）。延迟极低、丢包率接近 0%，是竞技游戏联机与对稳定性要求极高的严肃工作首选。</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-10 pt-6 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-wrap gap-6">
              <a href="/network" class="text-sm text-breeze-cyan hover:underline font-bold">查看微风完整网络说明 &rarr;</a>
              <a href="/dedicated-line" class="text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors">深入了解什么是专线机场 &rarr;</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 按用途选择 -->
    <section class="py-24 px-4 relative">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-16 text-center">您主要使用网络做什么？</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
          <div class="group bg-gradient-to-b from-[#131F33] to-[#0B1628] p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-breeze-cyan/50 transition-all hover:-translate-y-2 cursor-default">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gray-800 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-gray-300 mb-6 group-hover:bg-breeze-cyan/20 group-hover:text-breeze-cyan transition-colors">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 12a9 9 0 01-9 9m9-9a9 9 0 00-9-9m9 9H3m9 9a9 9 0 01-9-9m9 9c1.657 0 3-4.03 3-9s-1.343-9-3-9m0 18c-1.657 0-3-4.03-3-9s1.343-9 3-9m-9 9a9 9 0 019-9"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">日常网页浏览</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-6 line-clamp-3">对带宽和延迟要求中等，建议使用新加坡或日本等大容量节点，兼顾极快的响应与稳定性。</p>
            <a href="/network" class="text-breeze-cyan text-sm font-medium opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">查看建议 &rarr;</a>
          </div>
          
          <div class="group bg-gradient-to-b from-[#131F33] to-[#0B1628] p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-breeze-cyan/50 transition-all hover:-translate-y-2 cursor-default">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gray-800 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-gray-300 mb-6 group-hover:bg-breeze-cyan/20 group-hover:text-breeze-cyan transition-colors">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14.752 11.168l-3.197-2.132A1 1 0 0010 9.87v4.263a1 1 0 001.555.832l3.197-2.132a1 1 0 000-1.664z"></path><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">4K 影音娱乐</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-6 line-clamp-3">带宽至上，IP 解锁第二。利用大带宽中转节点，轻松解锁各区流媒体限制，晚高峰也能秒开 4K。</p>
            <a href="/guides/streaming-unlock" class="text-breeze-cyan text-sm font-medium opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">流媒体解锁指南 &rarr;</a>
          </div>
          
          <div class="group bg-gradient-to-b from-[#131F33] to-[#0B1628] p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-breeze-cyan/50 transition-all hover:-translate-y-2 cursor-default">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gray-800 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-gray-300 mb-6 group-hover:bg-breeze-cyan/20 group-hover:text-breeze-cyan transition-colors">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">AI 生产力工具</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-6 line-clamp-3">AI 平台对 IP 纯净度要求极高。我们提供原生节点，降低 ChatGPT/Claude 封号风险，无需频繁切换。</p>
            <a href="/guides/ai-unlock" class="text-breeze-cyan text-sm font-medium opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">AI 节点选择建议 &rarr;</a>
          </div>

          <div class="group bg-gradient-to-b from-[#131F33] to-[#0B1628] p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-breeze-cyan/50 transition-all hover:-translate-y-2 cursor-default">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gray-800 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-gray-300 mb-6 group-hover:bg-breeze-cyan/20 group-hover:text-breeze-cyan transition-colors">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10.325 4.317c.426-1.756 2.924-1.756 3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 002.573 1.066c1.543-.94 3.31.826 2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 001.065 2.572c1.756.426 1.756 2.924 0 3.35a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066 2.573c.94 1.543-.826 3.31-2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.572 1.065c-.426 1.756-2.924 1.756-3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.065-2.572c-1.756-.426-1.756-2.924 0-3.35a1.724 1.724 0 001.066-2.573c-.94-1.543.826-3.31 2.37-2.37.996.608 2.296.07 2.572-1.065z"></path><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">Clash 深度定制</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-6 line-clamp-3">完美兼容 Clash / Mihomo / Verge Rev，支持 Rule 与 TUN 模式智能分流，提供详尽排查教程。</p>
            <a href="/clash-airport" class="text-breeze-cyan text-sm font-medium opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">Clash 机场指南 &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 网络选择指南 -->
    <section class="py-20 px-4 bg-[#0B1628]/50 border-t border-white/5">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-end mb-12 gap-6">
          <div class="max-w-2xl">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">全网生态与选择指南</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400">除了提供微风网络服务，我们也为您整理了客观的网络工具与路线选购知识，帮助您避坑并做出最适合自己的选择。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
          <a href="/airport-recommendation" class="block p-6 bg-[#131F33] rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-gray-500 transition-colors">
            <div class="text-xs font-mono text-gray-500 mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">选购避坑</div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">2026 机场推荐指南</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">机场到底应该看线路、节点地区还是倍率？避坑参数全解析。</p>
            <span class="text-sm text-breeze-cyan font-bold flex items-center gap-1">阅读指南 <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path></svg></span>
          </a>
          <a href="/ladder-recommendation" class="block p-6 bg-[#131F33] rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-gray-500 transition-colors">
            <div class="text-xs font-mono text-gray-500 mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">工具对比</div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">梯子推荐与客户端选择</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">Windows, Mac, iOS, Android 各平台最适合的科学上网客户端是哪个？</p>
            <span class="text-sm text-breeze-cyan font-bold flex items-center gap-1">阅读指南 <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path></svg></span>
          </a>
          <a href="/clash-airport" class="block p-6 bg-[#131F33] rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-gray-500 transition-colors">
            <div class="text-xs font-mono text-gray-500 mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">硬核玩家</div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">Clash 机场进阶</h3>
