            <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-6 text-white hover:text-breeze-cyan transition-colors">
              <span>什么是“一键订阅”？我该怎么用？</span>
              <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180 text-gray-500">
                <svg fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div class="text-gray-400 mt-2 px-6 pb-6 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-white/5 pt-4">
              “订阅”是一串以 http 开头的专属私密链接。您不需要手动输入服务器 IP 和密码，只需将这串链接粘贴到您的客户端软件中，软件就会自动下载并配置好所有数十个网络节点及其分流规则。
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="group bg-[#131F33] rounded-xl border border-white/5 [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-6 text-white hover:text-breeze-cyan transition-colors">
              <span>我可以同时在电脑和手机上使用吗？</span>
              <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180 text-gray-500">
                <svg fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div class="text-gray-400 mt-2 px-6 pb-6 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-white/5 pt-4">
              是的。只要您的套餐并发设备限制允许（具体以套餐说明为准），您可以将同一个订阅链接导入到 Windows, Mac, iOS 和 Android 等多台设备上同时使用。
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="group bg-[#131F33] rounded-xl border border-white/5 [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-6 text-white hover:text-breeze-cyan transition-colors">
              <span>如果遇到节点连不上怎么办？</span>
              <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180 text-gray-500">
                <svg fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div class="text-gray-400 mt-2 px-6 pb-6 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-white/5 pt-4">
              这通常是因为系统代理没有正确开启，或者您的本地网络环境发生了改变。请首先尝试在客户端中点击“更新订阅”，然后切换节点测试。如果仍不行，请前往本站的“帮助中心”进行快速排查，或查看服务状态面板。
